    security question)"
  consoleLogs: " April 1st:\r\n //Open Door\r\n By Niel\r\nMarch 20th:\r\n//Open
    Door\r\n By Niel\r\nMarch 18th:\r\n//Message Duncan Cole, tell him he spelled
    my name wrong on the sign. It should be \u201Cwood\u201D, not \u201Cwoad\u201D.\r\n
    By Niel\r\nMarch 10th:\r\n //Register new user, Niel\r\n By Niel\r\n"
  accessQuestion: "What is Niel\u2019s Last Name?"
  accessAnswer: northwood
  textPosition: 0
  doorPermission: 0
